reported immediately, and equipment with a
damaged guard must not

87
00:06:13.571 --> 00:06:18.000
be operated. Source N-01, dated
2026-09-14, is supporting meeting-note

88
00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:22.429
context. It says Jordan reported the
