89
00:06:22.429 --> 00:06:26.857
until Friday. The team discussed a new
sign, and someone

90
00:06:26.857 --> 00:06:31.286
suggested experienced staff could skip eye
protection for a quick

91
00:06:31.286 --> 00:06:35.714
visit. No approval for that suggestion was
recorded, so it

92
00:06:35.714 --> 00:06:40.143
cannot replace P-01. Source S-01, exported
2026-09-15, is a supporting

93
00:06:40.143 --> 00:06:44.571
spreadsheet. Its equipment-room row
records guard status as damaged and

94
00:06:44.571 --> 00:06:49.000
