109
00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:55.435
We can now make the inventory decision
explicit. Include P-01

110
00:07:55.435 --> 00:07:59.870
as authoritative evidence because the task
asks for a current

111
00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:04.304
