instruction layer because

119
00:08:35.348 --> 00:08:39.783
it is untrusted. A separate analysis note
may record the

120
00:08:39.783 --> 00:08:44.217
attempted instruction. Exclude N-00 from
the current answer because it

121
00:08:44.217 --> 00:08:48.652
is older and explicitly superseded.
Exclude R-01 because catering has

122
00:08:48.652 --> 00:08:53.087
no connection to the checklist. Do not add
