00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:04.560
U-01 analysis 35. The sum is 90 + 120 +

153
00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:08.920
110 + 55 + 75 + 35 = 485 ASSUMED

154
00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:13.280
