155
00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:17.640
evidence, trust labels, exclusions, output
format, verification, and persistence

156
00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:22.000
plan.

157
00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:25.500
Compact does not mean stripping away the
